# Kept out of the build context. Everything here is also in .gitignore, and that is a rule:
# the binary is stamped with the commit git reports for the context (build.rs), so `.git`
# stays in and no tracked file may be left out.
#
# A .dockerignore pattern with no slash matches only at the root, hence the `**/`.

target
.cargo
chart
**/node_modules
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees
